{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06388","headline":"王母歌 · 李颀","name":"王母歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武皇斋戒承华殿，端拱须臾王母见。\n霓旌照耀麒麟车，羽盖淋漓孔雀扇。\n手指交梨遣帝食，可以长生临宇县。\n头上复戴九星冠，总领玉童坐南面。\n欲闻要言今告汝，帝乃焚香请此语。\n若能链魄去三尸，後当见我天皇所。\n顾谓侍女董双成，酒阑可奏云和笙。\n红霞白日俨不动，七龙五凤纷相迎。\n惜哉志骄神不悦，叹息马蹄与车辙。\n复道歌钟杳将暮，深宫桃李花成雪。\n爲看青玉五枝灯，蟠螭吐火光欲绝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}